# Wave W17-W (Route 211): lotus sand — bluff-top pale sand: a pale warm sand running Heritage’s edge to Apex’s dressed west door, design-authorised, kept soft and plain so the mountain’s dressed stone reads as the arrival (design: the bluff-top path east to the west door). Split from Route 208’s rest sand by a shade more light and less warmth — bluff air vs foothill ease — and from the Apex floors beyond the door by kind entire: sand yields to dressed flags at the threshold, as shipped.
